{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Vanessa and the Rude Customer", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "All in a Day's Work", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 11, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 5, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.1", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Accurately use important information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob11re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Offering Advice and Solutions", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you work in a restaurant or in a shop, it is important to offer advice and solutions properly.<Br><br>Remember to offer advice politely and to use the modals <span class=\"italic\">could</span>, <span class=\"italic\">should</span> or <span class=\"italic\">might</span> to propose a solution.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Here is a list of expressions you can use to offer advice and solutions:<br><br> <ul><li>You might want to ... </li> <li>Would you mind ... ?</li> <li>You should ... </li> <li>You ought to ... (strong request)</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Offering Advice\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Responding Politely\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <ul><li>You might want to ...</li> <li>Would you mind ... ?</li> <li>You should ... </li> <li>You ought to ... (strong request)</li> <li> ... don't you think?</li></ul>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>I understand, but ... </li> <li>I'm afraid not</li> <li>I apologize, but ... </li> <li>Here's what I think you could do</li> <li>That sounds reasonable</li></ul>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: I had to deal with angry patrons yesterday. <br><span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>: You really need to be more thick-skinned, dear! <br> <span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: I suppose you're right.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Being Persuasive", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you work in a restaurant or a shop, it is important to be persuasive to be able to change a customer's mind about something.<br><br>Remember to be polite and use appropriate expressions to persuade someone.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use expressions like <span class=\"italic\">Don't you think ... ?</span> or <span class=\"italic\">Don't you agree ... ?</span> to convince or persuade someone to change their minds.<br><br>You use expressions like <span class=\"italic\">You sound like ... </span> and use modals like <span class=\"italic\">should</span>, <span class=\"italic\">ought to</span> or <span class=\"italic\">would rather</span> to suggest what is necessary. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: Sometimes my clients are so difficult! <br> <span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>: I know, but happy customers would make your job easier, don't you think?", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "patron", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a customer at a restaurant or store ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Your loud conversation is bothering other patrons.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob11aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words to review.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "floor staff", "type": "name"}, {"content": "employees who work in a restaurant, setting and cleaning tables  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We train our floor staff to deal with difficult customers.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob11aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "complimentary", "type": "name"}, {"content": "at no additional cost  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Please enjoy a complimentary dessert.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob11aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "silent mode", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a setting on electronic devices that disables ringtones and alarms ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: Please put your phones on silent mode.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob11aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "reasonable", "type": "name"}, {"content": "fair and sensible", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: Thanks for the advice. It sounds reasonable.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob11aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "service industry ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "business that provides services or specialized work for customers ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We work in the service industry and we ought to treat our clients with care.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob11aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "miscommunication", "type": "name"}, {"content": "failure to communicate adequately  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I hope he doesn't write a complaint about our miscommunication problem.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob11aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "thick-skinned ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "insensitive to criticism or insults ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You need to be more thick-skinned!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob11aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "work-life balance", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the importance you put on work compared to other things, like family and friends ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It's important to keep a healthy  work-life balance.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le05ob11aud09", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Choose a person to interview. It could be a friend, a family member, or somebody you know.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask them about their job. Is it stressful? Do they work long hours? Where do they work?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "What do they do to de-stress at the end of the day?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a short presentation (10 to 12 lines) about the person.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Share your presentation with a friend.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I talk about healthy habits at work.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I describe a person's work.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write a presentation about a person I know.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn6le05ob11re2img06.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn6le05ob11re2img06.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Look at the articles I'm going to have to write next week! They're so interesting!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm glad you're having fun at work! I had to deal with angry patrons and miscommunication problems. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: That's why you look so tired! You really need to be more thick-skinned, dear!"}, {"image": "engenn6le05ob11re2img06.jpg", "time": "15500", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You know how the service industry works! Sometimes my clients are so difficult!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yeah ... I'm sure you'd rather deal with reasonable people all the time! What happened?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh, nothing ... Someone was rude to my floor staff, another customer refused to put his phone on silent mode ... Just a regular day at the restaurant!"}, {"image": "engenn6le05ob11re2img07.jpg", "time": "36000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You sound like you need some time off. You should try to keep a healthy work-life balance! Happy customers would make your job much easier, don't you think?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I suppose you're right. What do you think I should do?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You might want to offer complimentary drinks as soon as you hear something wrong. Everybody likes free stuff!"}], "audiosrc": "engenn6le05ob11re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le05ob11re2img06.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about healthy habits at work and customer service. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can offer advice and solutions.  ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can persuade someone to change his or her mind.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Do you have long days at work or at school? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What do you like to do to relax at the end of the day?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "  What advice would you give to a friend who is stressed out?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group